# Version 0.18.0 performs no automatic secret lookup.
# Read-only IMAP may reference HERMES_EMAIL_IMAP_USERNAME and HERMES_EMAIL_IMAP_PASSWORD.
# Disconnected SMTP transport may reference HERMES_EMAIL_SMTP_USERNAME and HERMES_EMAIL_SMTP_PASSWORD.
# Keep all values in the user-managed environment, never in this repository.
